{"id":63523079570894,"type":"album","name":"Les cinq saisons","artist":"Harmonium","year":1975,"weight":12,"info":{"cover":"https://dn711203.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-d7b786bd-6ba6-40a5-9d0c-e8c186755e49/mbid-d7b786bd-6ba6-40a5-9d0c-e8c186755e49-15335002244.jpg","yt":"NkNzlf2MczE","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/harmonium/les-cinq-saisons/"},"desc":"Si on avait besoin d'une cinquième saison (If We Needed a Fifth Season), also known as Les Cinq Saisons, is the second studio album of Progressive Rock band Harmonium. This album marks the departure from their first Folk Rock album \"Harmonium\" to much more of a unique progressive sound. Si on avait besoin d'une cinquième saison is based on conception of the seasons, with each of the first four tracks depicting one of the usual four seasons, spring, summer, autumn and winter, while the closing tune \"Histoires sans paroles\" symbolizes a fifth imaginary season. Some lyrics on this very album ."},"artist_ref":{"id":104932007019768,"name":"Harmonium","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":138197775829889,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":439,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":117566163487916,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":206,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":223327500886715,"type":"genre","name":"Contemporary Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":247,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":46651221575583,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Progressive Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":7,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":54706775234735,"name":"Brave New World: The Alternative RYM Canon","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":34,"year":null,"note":null,"total":88,"scaruffi":null},{"id":87310548737747,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Contemporary Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":81,"year":